		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_GUIDE_BODY_BIGGS">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_GUIDE_BODY_BIGGS" />
			<Property name="English" value="Corvettes are a completely bespoke class of starship - assembled piece by piece - with a traversable, furnished interior. These habitable ships are constructed in a similar fashion to planetary bases, and can be fitted out internally with living areas such as nutrition units and bunk beds.&#xA;&#xA;Excavate Corvette &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;modules&lt;&gt; from &lt;STELLAR&gt;salvage containers&lt;&gt; found buried on some worlds. Scan planets with the starship scanner to detect buried &lt;STELLAR&gt;salvageable scrap&lt;&gt;. Modules determine the aesthetics of the ship, and many modules also enhance specific ship &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;stats&lt;&gt;, such as damage potential or shield strength.&#xA;&#xA;Begin Corvette creation at a &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Corvette Workshop&lt;&gt;, found aboard &lt;VAL_ON&gt;Space Stations&lt;&gt; by the large landing pads near the station entrance tunnel. A number of basic modules can also be &lt;STELLAR&gt;purchased&lt;&gt; from the Workshop.&#xA;&#xA;Select &lt;STELLAR&gt;finalise&lt;&gt; to complete a Corvette design, or exit the Workshop to resume it later.&#xA;&#xA;Once a Corvette's structure is finalised, you can add internal decorations by stepping inside the ship and accessing the &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Build Menu&lt;&gt; with &lt;IMG&gt;BUILD_MENU&lt;&gt;. The structure of a finalised Corvette can be also &lt;STELLAR&gt;modified&lt;&gt; at the Corvette Workshop at any time." />
			<Property name="French" value="" />
			<Property name="Italian" value="" />
			<Property name="German" value="" />
