			<Property name="English" value="A number of worlds contain remnants of &lt;STELLAR&gt;salvageable scrap&lt;&gt; and &lt;STELLAR&gt;industrial waste&lt;&gt;. Scan planets from space to identify scrap worlds.&#xA;&#xA;Salvageable scrap is often highly &lt;COMMODITY&gt;valuable&lt;&gt;, and can be sold at a &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Galactic Trade Terminal&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Salvage containers are also a rich source of &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;modules&lt;&gt; used to construct a Corvette-class Starship.&#xA;&#xA;Install a &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Gravitino Coil&lt;&gt; in the Multi-Tool to &lt;VAL_ON&gt;magnetise&lt;&gt; and &lt;VAL_ON&gt;manipulate&lt;&gt; deposits of &lt;STELLAR&gt;industrial waste&lt;&gt;. Large stacks of industrial waste can be hauled across the planet in a &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Colossus Exocraft&lt;&gt;, and deposited for rewards at a &lt;STELLAR&gt;Waste Processing Plant&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;While driving a Colossus on a scrap world, use the &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Exocraft Radar&lt;&gt; in the Quick Menu (&lt;IMG&gt;QUICK_MENU&lt;&gt;) to locate nearby &lt;STELLAR&gt;Processing Plants&lt;&gt; and &lt;STELLAR&gt;Waste Heaps&lt;&gt;." />
