			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_00" />
			<Property name="English" value="I was contacted by an unusual Autophage, Divergence Fragment Yabli-α, whose body was in the shape of a starship. They believed they could rebuild &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Atlantid&lt;&gt;, using &lt;FUEL&gt;Atlas&lt;&gt; as a scaffold for growth.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ She is spreading. Growing, beneath the surface. But the walls of glass are thick. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Yabli-α asked me to scan for what my eyes could not see; to compile a seed of &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Memories of Atlantid&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Atlas will respond. It will not have forgotten her data.&#xA;This is an opportunity to restore what was lost, so long ago.&#xA;She will return: in stellar multitudes. }}-&lt;&gt;" />
