		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_01">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_01" />
			<Property name="English" value="I sought out Yabli-α in deep space, and showed them the compiled memories.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Disruptor, this seed can grow a new prime.&#xA;And then more - &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kzzzt&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; - trillions - &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kztkzt&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; - across the leylines - &lt;STELLAR&gt;kkzzkktkkk&lt;&gt; - }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;For a time, their voice was consumed by static. When the signal finally stabilised, the Autophage was mid-sentence:&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ - &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kzkkzt&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; - components. The scaffold, and the backdoor. }}-&#xA;-{{ Atlas is the optimal scaffold. Unlimited access. The route to her reconnection. }}-&#xA;-{{ Atlas favours you. Grants you audience. You are its flaw. A backdoor to the architecture of reality. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;They asked that I plant the seed discreetly, that I sideload the &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Memories of Atlantid&lt;&gt; into an &lt;FUEL&gt;Atlas Interface&lt;&gt;." />
