		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_02">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_02" />
			<Property name="English" value="The Atlas had created the infinite. Yet the only reality I knew was this one; the only time I had seen was now. How much past did the Atlas still contain, how many long-dead stars?&#xA;&#xA;As I planted the memories, the interface began to shut down, extinguishing the lights of its terminal line by line.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;[ TIMELINE CANNOT BE RESOLVED ]&#xA;[ ANOMALY &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;BREACH&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; DETECTED ]&#xA;[ FUNCTION: PRESERVE SYSTEM INTEGRITY ]&#xA;[ PURGING &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;DISSONANT&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; INTERFACE FROM NETWORK ]&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Only a single source of light remained on the screen, a string of characters blinking against the darkness.&#xA;&#xA;When I reached out and touched them, a thousand voices cried out at once. The screen re-ignited, awash with colour. The terminal became a kaleidoscope of images, endless memories streaming from the data packet and into the interface.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;- Manifestation parameters defined -&#xA;Lifeform: &lt;&gt;&lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;%PURP_S_RACE%&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;&#xA;Primary celestial body: &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;%PURP_P1%&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;&#xA;Secondary celestial body: &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;%PURP_P2%&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;The cloud of memories that swarmed around the interface collapsed, their infinite dance of possibility coalescing to a single reality. The terminal fell silent.&#xA;&#xA;I felt a sudden sharp sense of dislocation, of the strangeness of my own body. What was I doing there?&#xA;&#xA;What had I just done?" />
