			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_03" />
			<Property name="English" value="&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ I felt it, disruptor. I felt it! An ache in my own crystals. A burst of life. She has manifested a star! }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;Stellar Manifestation &lt;IMG&gt;SLASH&lt;&gt; Erased Sector Restored&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;I asked Yabli-α how to reach it.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ I built my body in haste. My vision is limited. But yours - }}-&#xA;-{{ Of course. Your ship is not compatible. Her space will always be dissonant with this reality. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;But they had an idea.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Over the years, I have detected an anomalous space station. There is a Construct aboard. A complex entity. They know many things. They will know how to configure your hyperdrive. }}-&lt;&gt;" />
