			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_04" />
			<Property name="English" value="The Assembled Construct did not seem surprised to see me.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ other-entity. you-entity. it is you. it was you? i... i felt something. sky-rattle. glass-boom. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;They taught me the blueprint for an &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Atlantid Drive&lt;&gt;, to allow my Starship to reach &lt;SPECIAL&gt;dissonant space&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ i &lt;SPECIAL&gt;remember&lt;&gt; the ship-configuration. here. now you &lt;SPECIAL&gt;remember&lt;&gt;, too. }}-&#xA;-{{ not-possible space is anomaly, but you are anomaly too. ship-configuration is safe. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;As I turned to leave, they asked if they could follow, if I could help them reach the restored system.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ i... would like to see not-possible space, too. other-entity would be anchor. call for anomaly-shell there? }}-&lt;&gt;" />
