			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_05" />
			<Property name="English" value="I notified the Construct of their safe arrival in dissonant space.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ where... no-where? we are here! in the not-possible space. i... i know. in my shell-parts. in echo-souls. }}-&#xA;-{{ but this space is still not-possible. lost-other cannot enter. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;It seemed Yabli-α would not be able to enter the system. Not yet. It was still hazy, still &quot;part crimson-dream&quot;.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ polo-builder builds with an unbound mind. anomaly-shell slips between. }}-&#xA;-{{ not-possible space could become possible. unbound polo-builder could study the glass. bind this space. make it real. }}-&lt;&gt;" />
