		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_06">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_06" />
			<Property name="English" value="I found Specialist Polo absorbed in a matrix of figures.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Curious data here, Traveller-Friend. Very curious! }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;They gave me a knowing look. Their eyes twinkled.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Places exist, or they do not exist, yes? No! The Anomaly reports something else.&#xA;Our home has docked in the in-between! It is curious, yes? }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;I told Polo about the &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Memories of Atlantid&lt;&gt;, and how the Atlas restored this dissonant system. The Gek nodded along, their expression growing brighter with every word.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Oh, Traveller-Friend. You are always full of surprises!&#xA;New memories, new space! New reality? Are you same you from last meeting? Am I same Polo? It is marvellous not to know! }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;When I asked Polo about the &quot;not-possible space&quot;, they noted the strangeness of the Construct's term.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ This space is possible! Just not easy to find. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;They made a quick calculation, their brow furrowed.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Yes, Traveller-Friend. I think we could do it. Open system permissions. Welcome all friends here!&#xA;But... have you spoken to Nada-Friend? Atlantid, Atlas... these are difficult subjects. Please, first, speak kindly with Nada. }}-&lt;&gt;" />
