		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_07">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_07" />
			<Property name="English" value="&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Where are we, Traveller-Entity? Nada felt suddenly weightless. The hunt of the Convergence, lifted. It is as though Nada is invisible. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;I told Nada about meeting Yabli-α, and how the unusual Autophage helped me to compile &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Memories of Atlantid&lt;&gt; from the seeds of Korvax Echoes. I explained that the Atlas absorbed the compiled memories, and used them to restore this system - but Nada perceived it differently.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Atlas-Falsity did nothing. This Atlantid is born of the memories Friend-Entity compiled. Matter from minds. A universe in every soul. }}-&#xA;-{{ Prime was home to so many souls, Friend-Entity. Innumerable to non-Korvax mind. Eheu. Nada cannot explain the depths of this loss. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;I went on to explain what I discussed with Polo. This system was an anomaly, disconnected from the universe. But it did not have to be  - we could devise a way to allow others into this space.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Access for lost Builder-Entities? }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Nada was quiet for a moment, thinking.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ This system is an old place, from before Nada was divergent.&#xA;Yet, Nada is here. Friend-Entity has caused paradox.&#xA;This whole space is also divergent. An error, outside of order.&#xA;Here, Convergence cannot reach Nada. Safety for errors. A sanctuary.&#xA;Lost entities also deserve sanctuary. But we cannot know what it means to open this system...&#xA;Cannot know if... }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Nada's electronic voice wavered.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Will Friend-Entity give Nada some time? Nada wishes to think. }}-&lt;&gt;" />
