			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_08" />
			<Property name="English" value="Polo looked past me, concern glittering in their eyes as they watched their Korvax friend.&#xA;&#xA;The moment passed quickly. Polo reassumed their characteristic warmth.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Traveller-Friend, do not worry for Nada. I will worry! They will be fine.&#xA;I have looked at system data, had help from clever Construct-Friend. Very high confidence in schematic, yes! Our experiment together! }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;They shared their design for a &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Reality Anchor&lt;&gt;: a device to bind this place to the rest of reality." />
