			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_09" />
			<Property name="English" value="&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ A perfect job, Traveller-Friend! It is grounded in these worlds, you see? Built from their earth. Proof that this space is possible! }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Polo explained that they and Nada had spoken, and that Nada had a proposal for how to bind the system.&#xA;&#xA;I consulted with Nada to hear their idea.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Friend-Entity has touched the remade worlds. Absorbed old memories into your own. May Nada see? }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Nada touched the anchor, nodding thoughtfully.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Nada's relic-machine holds a version of the old places. Not as they are now, but as I remember them. As many-minds remember, living in simulation.&#xA;Old will meet reborn. Two streams merge and create their own river. Bind this system. I offer it willingly. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;When I asked what would happen next, Nada did not know.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Crimson-Entity will see signal. Convergence may also see. May continue their hunt for Nada shell.&#xA;But Anomaly home is safe. Nada knows. Fear is no way to live.&#xA;Nada trusts you, Friend-Entity. Let us welcome others. It is right to try. }}-&lt;&gt;" />
