		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_10">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_10" />
			<Property name="English" value="I touched the interface, and the ancient computer unlocked immediately. I could somehow feel Nada's presence there, their electric pulse in the wires.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;NADA–ENTITY AUTHORISATION DETECTED&#xA;MAINFRAME NODE CONNECTED [ &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;SPACE ANOMALY&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; ]&#xA;...&#xA;LOADING INSTRUCTION SET [ &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;REALITY ANCHOR&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; ]&#xA;...&#xA;PARSING [ UNBOUND SYSTEM ]... PARSING [ SIMULATION &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;19&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; ]...&lt;&gt;&#xA;&lt;TRADEABLE&gt;VIABLE TIMELINE EXCURSION FOUND!&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;&#xA;PATCHING DIFF &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;#1616X&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;...&#xA;...&#xA;RESPONSE: &lt;&gt;&lt;FUEL&gt;WRITE ACCESS DENIED&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Something had gone wrong. The same error printed over and over. Write access denied.&#xA;The machine's ancient speakers clicked. Nada's voice filtered through the static, soft and thoughtful.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ An error, Friend-Entity. Anchor alone cannot bridge reality-gap. }}-&#xA;-{{ Nada thinks you understand. Friend-Entity is the &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;breach&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;, the anomaly, the free... The breach can be the bridge. }}-&#xA;-{{ But before the seed, a scaffold. A small device to assemble. }}-&#xA;-{{ It will be beautiful. The stars will be a lifeboat, and all of space a little more free... }}-&lt;&gt;" />
