			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_11" />
			<Property name="English" value="I returned to Nada's Terminal Prime, to align the Anomalous Scaffold.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;LOADING INSTRUCTION SET [ &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;REALITY ANCHOR&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; | &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;ANOMALY BREACH PROTOCOL&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; ]&#xA;...&#xA;PARSING [ UNBOUND SYSTEM ]... PARSING [ SIMULATION &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;19&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; ]...&lt;&gt;&#xA;&lt;TRADEABLE&gt;VIABLE TIMELINE EXCURSION FOUND!&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;&#xA;PATCHING DIFF &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;#1616X&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;...&#xA;...&#xA;RESPONSE: &lt;&gt;&lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;TIMELINE AUTHENTICATED&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; ]&#xA;RESPONSE: [ WRITE SIGNATURE ? ]&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;The machine hummed, its frequency aligned with the gentle vibration of the scaffold. All it required was me.&#xA;&#xA;I offered my hand.&#xA;&#xA;There was a sharp, sudden pain as something incorporeal pierced my palm. Colour flooded the scaffold as &lt;COMMODITY&gt;gold&lt;&gt;, &lt;SPECIAL&gt;glass&lt;&gt;, and the &lt;FUEL&gt;crimson&lt;&gt; of my own blood merged and froze within its delicate crystal lattice.&#xA;&#xA;I felt lightheaded, as if the machine had absorbed some part of my being.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;C R Y S T A L&#xA;L A T T I C E&#xA;P R O P A G A T I N G&lt;&gt;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;...&lt;&gt;&#xA;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;M U L T I T U D E S&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;As the machine was locking down, I heard something else.&#xA;&#xA;She whispered through my bones, her voice like distant thunder.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;Thank you, Traveller-child.&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; }}-&lt;&gt;" />
