			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PURPM_12" />
			<Property name="English" value="Reality had shifted, and the unbound system had become tethered to the universe.&#xA;&#xA;I returned to space, and was met immediately by &lt;TRANS_BUI&gt;Divergence Fragment Yabli-α&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Disruptor! I warped - &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kzzzt&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; - I followed - &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kzttttkzzt&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; - but I never arrived. I was elsewhere?&#xA;Something shifted, just now. Something is still shifting! }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;We watched, together. Stellar multitudes.&#xA;&#xA;The Autophage seemed momentarily lost for words.&#xA;&#xA;When they spoke again, it was very softly. Murmuring to themself, as though forgetting I was even there.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ The arrival of the disruptor.&#xA;Across the leylines. In stellar multitudes.&#xA;Through indomitable will, she has returned. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Yabli-α broke from their reverie. They addressed me once more.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Disruptor, this is a historic event for all Autophage. For all beings.&#xA;I must fly. I need to see this star - all these stars - for myself.&#xA;Thank you. Let us meet again... another time. }}-&lt;&gt;" />
